    "title": "Fire Inspection Recurring Contracts: Building Predictable Recurring Revenue",
    "description": "How fire inspection software turns one-off visits into recurring contracts with predictable revenue by automating renewal cycles, billing, and retention.",
    "date": "2026-01-03",
