    "title": "Fire Inspection Emergency Service Calls: Handling Urgent Work Without Chaos",
    "description": "How fire inspection software absorbs urgent, unscheduled service calls, dispatches the right technician fast, and captures emergency work without derailing the inspection route.",
    "date": "2026-04-09",
